# Collection (collection.md) commits ONLY the aggregated .txt files + collection_notes.md
# per company. Raw source documents are downloaded to a scratch dir, text-extracted, and
# discarded — never committed (they are GBs at scale, and only the extracted text is read
# by the analysis agent). These patterns are a safety net against accidentally adding a raw file.
To-Analyze/**/*.pdf
To-Analyze/**/*.xlsx
To-Analyze/**/*.zip
To-Analyze/**/*.html
To-Analyze/**/*.csv
